#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:5
#: 566c8d0b55a3481fbf901f3e1cc444d3
msgid "Archived:PX4 Wiring QuickStart"
msgstr "已归档：PX4 接线快速入门"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:9
#: b5a861350736421bb808a13a707696ff
msgid "**ARCHIVED**"
msgstr "**已归档**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:11
#: 87440641c85340e9a96d5132547b003f
msgid ""
"The PX4 is end of life and is not generally available for purchase. This "
"article is made available for existing users."
msgstr "PX4 已停产，通常无法购买。本文仅供现有用户参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:14
#: 1fe025a60973442288ff00a18d3c3216
msgid ""
"This article provides an overview of the :ref:`PX4FMU <common-px4fmu-"
"overview>` and :ref:`PX4IO <common-px4io-overview>` Board Plane "
"Wiring/Installation."
msgstr ""
"本文概述了 :ref:`PX4FMU <common-px4fmu-overview>` 和 :ref:`PX4IO <common-px4io-"
"overview>` 板的 Plane 接线/安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:18
#: a3fbdedcd9324fec993faf0afb4f3aaf
msgid "PX4FMU plus PX4IO Wiring Diagram for Plane"
msgstr "Plane 的 PX4FMU 加 PX4IO 接线图"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:27
#: f4e1c1a3d1cf42959815b64cde6d7a5f
msgid "Assembly"
msgstr "组装"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:30
#: 1a550924701f4a348a7e63954b175a6a
msgid ""
"**Solder the right angle 9x3 pin connector that was included with your PX4 "
"kit to the side of the PX4IO board that has \"PX4 autopilot\" printed on "
"it.**"
msgstr "**将 PX4 套件中包含的直角 9x3 针连接器焊接到 PX4IO 板上印有「PX4 autopilot」的那一侧。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:34
#: 14c50c6b5bfd44b9b5cd71040567aa50
msgid ""
"When you insert the 9 x 3 connector into the PX4IO board put it in with the "
"plastic spacer on the connector facing to the back of the board, NOT down "
"against the board."
msgstr "将 9x3 连接器插入 PX4IO 板时，连接器上的塑料间隔件应朝向板背面，而不是向下靠着板。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:38
#: 6d617730710843939230dca20d2b5477
msgid ""
"**Solder the small white PAP-02-VS 2 pin connector into the 2 holes directly"
" behind the battery pads on the PX4IO board.**"
msgstr "**将小型白色 PAP-02-VS 2 针连接器焊接到 PX4IO 板上电池焊盘正后方的 2 个孔中。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:40
#: 4805a56684cd4de6b9b25e32c1d48a86
msgid "**Install the PX4IO board on top of the PX4FMU board.**"
msgstr "**将 PX4IO 板安装在 PX4FMU 板上。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:42
#: 5add840f1b294d7ca9724b31483376d9
msgid ""
"Ensure all of the connector pins are straight and insertion is complete."
msgstr "确保所有连接器针脚笔直且插入完全。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:44
#: 1517bb5760b64875ad5467490817a5f9
msgid ""
"Mount the PX4-FMU + PX4-IO board stack in a central and level location on "
"top of your Plane."
msgstr "将 PX4-FMU + PX4-IO 板组安装在飞机顶部的中央水平位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:46
#: cac04831185f435aadb204c830dbc5bc
msgid "The PX4FMU board is normally on top."
msgstr "PX4FMU 板通常在顶部。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:47
#: f45634f172084cf1b21a4c057f9139c8
msgid ""
"It can be advantageous to mount the PX4IO board on top to provide for better"
" Connector access."
msgstr "将 PX4IO 板安装在顶部可以提供更好的连接器访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:49
#: 05a644ddc5d744dfb4e8f1f76924cdb7
msgid ""
"If you do mount the PX4IO board on top it will be necessary to set the "
"\"Board Orientation (AHRS_ORIENTATION)\" parameter to \"Roll 180\" in the "
"Advanced Parameter List in Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"如果将 PX4IO 板安装在顶部，则需要在 Mission Planner 高级参数列表中将「Board "
"Orientation（AHRS_ORIENTATION）」参数设为「Roll 180」。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:52
#: c65e0089f1a54a9cadcec593d2dcdaed
msgid "The arrow labeled \"FRONT\" should be facing to the front of the aircraft."
msgstr "标有\"FRONT\"的箭头应朝向飞机前方。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:54
#: 3ddfdfb9c0674c068c3dba04f5b62892
msgid ""
"The Micro SD memory card holder should face to the back of the Aircraft."
msgstr "Micro SD 存储卡槽应朝向飞机后方。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:57
#: 0d846ed8aa1f464a875fc41ca58fd479
msgid "**Use the included standoffs and hardware.**"
msgstr "**使用随附的支撑柱和硬件。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:59
#: 784d0f701c9f4741830f5638985854b7
msgid ""
"Which ever side of which ever board is going to be on top but a black "
"standoff through one of the mounting holes from the bottom and thread a "
"black plastic nut onto it from the top."
msgstr "无论哪块板的哪一面将朝上，从底部将黑色螺柱穿过其中一个安装孔，然后从顶部将黑色塑料螺母拧上。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:62
#: 371bbed24355425cb56402dbb1c13459
msgid "Repeat the above for the remaining 3 holes."
msgstr "对剩余的 3 个孔重复上述操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:63
#: 3ee9fdc5a3d04c3196a3441cf1087b2b
msgid ""
"Connect the PX4FMU and PX4IO board insuring no pins are bent on the board "
"interconnection connector."
msgstr "连接 PX4FMU 和 PX4IO 板，确保板间连接连接器上没有弯曲的针脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:65
#: ea869c765d2a40e4b02f0f5baddf78fd
msgid ""
"Thread 4 more of the black standoffs into the already installed black "
"standoffs."
msgstr "将另外 4 个黑色支撑柱拧入已安装的黑色支撑柱中。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:68
#: eed40d8ba8214a85acd5dcf6a870442b
msgid ""
"**You will need additional vibration damping and you should also review the "
"Wiki section on vibration control.**"
msgstr "**您需要额外的减震措施，还应查阅关于减震的 Wiki 章节。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:71
#: 86b2a6c648fc4e748b397192e7eae2d6
msgid "At a minimum you should mount the standoffs to an intermediate plate."
msgstr "至少应将支撑柱固定到中间板上。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:73
#: e005c9c733ef4cb1a554d00deb3506ec
msgid ""
"Mount the plate to your airframe with 4 small (<1\")square pads of Kyosho "
"\"Zeal\" gel or \"Moon Gel\" in the corners."
msgstr "用4块小型（<1英寸）方形Kyosho \"Zeal\"凝胶垫或\"Moon Gel\"垫粘贴在角落，将该板固定到机架上。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:76
#: 77559e1f02334a5ba80ed2391c16fd2f
msgid "**Mount the GPS facing up with an unobstructed \"view\" of the sky.**"
msgstr "**将 GPS 朝上安装，确保对天空有无遮挡的「视野」。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:78
#: aa714b6ae6ac451f8cc8ec4a7e63c305
msgid "Connect the GPS cable to the GPS connector on the PX4FMU board."
msgstr "将 GPS 电缆连接到 PX4FMU 板上的 GPS 连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:79
#: 515da3fe8018493fbaed798b29ea1cdf
msgid ""
"The GPS must be positioned so that its cable will connect without strain to "
"the PX4FMU's GPS connector."
msgstr "GPS 的安装位置必须使其电缆能无张力地连接到 PX4FMU 的 GPS 连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:81
#: 024882f99e1243d7bd4ed33f0ec37de4
msgid ""
"The GPS can be mounted on a short riser to give it the widest satellite "
"access."
msgstr "GPS 可以安装在短的支架上，以获得最广的卫星接收范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:86
#: c14d437788b541a991446bafe418be85
msgid "Wire the PX4FMU and PX4IO boards to Your Plane"
msgstr "将 PX4FMU 和 PX4IO 板连接到飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:88
#: 82730a3ee50445e0a505058b55da1bf1
msgid "**Wire the PX4-IO board.**"
msgstr "**连接 PX4-IO 板。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:90
#: 41179664935e4adc9884d47f2efe8150
msgid ""
"The PX4IO board has a built in Power Supply which can connect to up to 18 "
"volts."
msgstr "PX4IO 板内置电源模块，可接受最高 18V 的输入电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:92
#: 5fe0977efb774073b45c1d07ce397289
msgid ""
"Insert the white PAP-02-VS 2 pin connector with the black and red wires "
"coming out of it into the mating power connector you soldered in previously "
"on the PX4IO board."
msgstr "将带有黑色和红色导线的白色 PAP-02-VS 2 针连接器插入先前在 PX4IO 板上焊接的配套电源连接器中。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:95
#: 6bcbcf3f20db451b83bdb1d644fc5f32
msgid ""
"Battery Plus is the(red wire) and should be soldered to your battery red "
"power lead / connector."
msgstr "电池正极为（红线），应焊接到电池的红色电源导线/接口上。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:97
#: 8835fb8311744b4195622b1e31c6953d
msgid ""
"Battery Ground is the(black wire) and should be soldered to your battery "
"black battery (Ground) lead / connector."
msgstr "电池地线为（黑线），应焊接到电池黑色电池（地线）引线/连接器上。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:99
#: 864206fb67324804a114c0cf09bc6fe3
msgid ""
"The main power inputs of your ESC's will also need to connect to these wires"
" and to a battery connector."
msgstr "您的ESC主电源输入也需要连接到这些导线以及电池接口上。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:101
#: 0c1f13222a0548f3884166c3bd65414b
msgid "A Power Distribution board can also be used."
msgstr "也可以使用电源分配板。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:103
#: df101dad4d06446ba55040c369d1dda2
msgid ""
"**Connect your PPM-Sum RC receiver's 3 wire cable to the end of the 9 x 3 "
"angle connector that is nearest the edge of the PX4IO board with the signal "
"wire furthest from the board and the ground closest to the board.**"
msgstr "**将 PPM-Sum 遥控接收机的 3 线电缆连接到 9x3 角连接器靠近 PX4IO 板边缘的一端，信号线远离板面，地线靠近板面。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:107
#: fa600078c1d74b81ac1cc5613ce205f0
msgid ""
"**Wire the PX4 boards servo out signals to your Servo / ESC control "
"inputs.**"
msgstr "**将 PX4 板的舵机输出信号连接到舵机/ESC 控制输入。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:110
#: 01b2ccc1495e42dba5332cf869efc7c5
msgid ""
"The ESCs BEC or a separate UBEC can supply servo power to the Servos via the"
" PX4's Servo connector BUSS"
msgstr "ESC 的 BEC 或独立 UBEC 可通过 PX4 舵机连接器总线为舵机提供电源"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:113
#: 136aa0b656414dd1ba50228e9062f74d
msgid ""
"Run the 3 wire servo cables from the ESC (and its built in BEC) and Servos "
"to the 3 x 9 Servo Connector on the PX4IO board."
msgstr "将 ESC（及其内置 BEC）和舵机的 3 线舵机电缆连接到 PX4IO 板上的 3x9 舵机连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:115
#: 05679dc405664a479cac3ac77802778e
msgid ""
"Or, clip the power lead on the ESC and run power and ground from a separate "
"UBEC to the bottom pins of the Servo connector."
msgstr "或者，剪断 ESC 上的电源引线，将独立 UBEC 的电源和地线连接到舵机连接器底部针脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:118
#: ad744e9bdfd140d68254457ecb5707dd
msgid ""
"The PX4IO board connector for Servo 1 is at the edge of the connector next "
"to the Battery power in wires."
msgstr "PX4IO 板上舵机 1 的连接器位于靠近电池电源输入线一侧的连接器边缘。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:120
#: dbeec39b496243ad8758ad09f5582655
msgid ""
"Insert the Servo and Motor ESC signal wires arranged progressively from that"
" edge, (1,2,3,4,etc)."
msgstr "从该边缘开始，按顺序插入舵机和电机 ESC 信号线（1、2、3、4 等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:122
#: 30ecaf2f9766495c8056f72d98b4d511
msgid ""
"You can put the ESC / Servo Signal wires into a single inline connector with"
" the correct number of pins for your Plane."
msgstr "您可以将 ESC/舵机信号线放入一个单行连接器中，针脚数量与飞机所需的一致。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:124
#: cb222bd8accb43d896bec6d7d61f89d7
msgid ""
"The ESC / Servo Signal Wires / connector should be plugged into the top row "
"(furthest from the board) of the PX4IO boards 3 x 9 Servo Connector."
msgstr "ESC/舵机信号线/连接器应插入 PX4IO 板 3x9 舵机连接器的顶行（距板面最远）。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:128
#: 45df71da7ad44405ac71bf05169fa013
msgid ""
"**Note, the cable that is supplied in the plastic envelope with the UBLOX "
"GPS which has white 6 pin connectors on both ends is not the correct cable "
"for the PX4FMU board.**"
msgstr "**注意，UBLOX GPS 塑料包装内附赠的两端都是白色 6 针连接器的电缆，不是适用于 PX4FMU 板的正确电缆。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:132
#: c1487a6f295e420b99211a56d3593828
msgid ""
"The correct longer cable is provided in a separate envelope and has a 5 pin "
"\"beige\" connector on one end and a 6 pin white connector on the other end."
msgstr "正确的较长电缆在单独的包装中，一端有 5 针「米色」连接器，另一端有 6 针白色连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:135
#: 6742dc6e127f4432a51e300fc0c58787
msgid ""
"Plug the correct GPS cable's white 6 pin connector into the 6 pin socket on "
"the GPS."
msgstr "将正确 GPS 线缆的白色 6 针连接器插入 GPS 上的 6 针插座。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:137
#: 59e109f9a97d479f8008d8f0f001d644
msgid ""
"Plug the beige 5 pin connector into the PX4FMU board's 5 pin GPS socket "
"which is next to the 15 pin DF13 Mini connector."
msgstr "将米色 5 针连接器插入 PX4FMU 板上的 5 针 GPS 插座，该插座位于 15 针 DF13 Mini 连接器旁边。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:140
#: e79113cf1e50440da216c757385e5af6
msgid ""
"**Plug the 2 pin connector attached to the lead supplied with the buzzer "
"into the buzzer socket on the side of the PX4FMU board that has the SD card "
"holder on it.**"
msgstr "**将蜂鸣器附带导线上的 2 针连接器插入 PX4FMU 板带有 SD 卡槽一侧的蜂鸣器插座。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:143
#: 09f6b20425ef4f76bb2ecda390b3c5a4
msgid ""
"**Connect the \"Safety Button\" to the Safety button connector on the PX4IO "
"board on the opposite side of the board from the Battery pads.**"
msgstr "**将「安全按钮」连接到 PX4IO 板上电池焊盘对面的安全按钮连接器。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:147
#: 213f4914b92e4a078fef600ae141ac4d
msgid ""
"**The PX4 must have its \"Safety\" mechanism disengaged before it can be "
"armed.**"
msgstr "**PX4 必须先解除其「安全」机制才能解锁。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:150
#: 0938adb63f8842dc91f27fa109a4327a
msgid "**PX4 Safety Button LED Indications:**"
msgstr "**PX4 安全按钮 LED 指示：**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:152
#: 2343f628db3b4bdbb2119e5076963298
msgid ""
"Fast Blinking indicates: Error Condition, Safety cannot be disengaged. "
"Possibly not calibrated or sensor error."
msgstr "快速闪烁表示：错误状态，无法解除安全锁。可能未完成校准或传感器故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:154
#: 281ed2abcee94abb87ad850f4007b741
msgid ""
"Slow Blinking indicates: Safe condition. Safety can be disengaged by "
"depressing Safety Button for 5 seconds."
msgstr "慢速闪烁表示：安全状态。可以通过按住安全按钮 5 秒来脱开安全开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:156
#: 3c248338147c477685ee84ba25f33452
msgid ""
"LED Continuously on indicates: Safety has been disengaged. Depending on your"
" parameter settings, throttle may be armed with Throttle down and to the "
"right.  For details on arming see: :ref:`Arming Plane <arming-your-plane>`."
msgstr ""
"LED 持续亮表示：安全已解除。根据参数设置，油门向下并向右可能会解锁油门。解锁详情参见：:ref:`Arming Plane <arming-"
"your-plane>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:160
#: c7770c781f5e439d9ea68e7f4e5983ee
msgid ""
"When the LED is continuously on indicating Safety Disengaged it may be "
"toggled back to a Safety engaged condition by depressing the Safety button "
"for 5 seconds."
msgstr "当 LED 持续亮起表示安全开关已脱开时，可以通过按住安全按钮 5 秒切换回安全接合状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:164
#: 5d6ec0c1f822439fbb822b7b25a58666
msgid ""
"**Both the Safety engaged and Safety disengaged conditions require the "
"button to be held down for 5 seconds to toggle them.**. This is a safety "
"mechanism to prevent accidental disarming during flight and accidental "
"arming during transportation."
msgstr "**安全接合和安全解除两种状态都需要按住按钮 5 秒才能切换。** 这是一种安全机制，防止飞行中意外上锁以及运输过程中意外解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:170
#: 4859f822458d494b90bd7457d62a5423
msgid "Using a SiK telemetry radio with your PX4FMU plus PX4IO system."
msgstr "将 SiK 数传无线电与您的 PX4FMU 加 PX4IO 系统配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:172
#: 524c9f8462294bf8bc0550148bda4643
msgid "You will need a :ref:`SiK Radio <common-sik-telemetry-radio>`."
msgstr "您将需要一个 :ref:`SiK 无线电 <common-sik-telemetry-radio>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:173
#: 69bbf18779d04ed6851a37ee5020f31c
msgid ""
"Plug the telemetry adapter cable's large black connector into the SiK Radio "
"as shown above."
msgstr "将数传适配电缆的大黑色连接器插入 SiK 无线电，如上图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:175
#: 64b0967f57494e9e97e4738ac7867d26
msgid ""
"The telemetry radio is shown above **incorrectly** connected to the FMU "
"USART2 socket at the corner of the PX4IO board."
msgstr "数传无线电在上图中显示为 **错误地** 连接到 PX4IO 板角落的 FMU USART2 插座。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:178
#: 4b0148813b5e41d492073fad1a1b4cd3
msgid ""
"**Correctly** plug the telemetry adapter cable's beige connector into the "
"PX4IO boards **FMU UART5** socket."
msgstr "**正确地** 将数传适配电缆的米色连接器插入 PX4IO 板的 **FMU UART5** 插座。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:180
#: 98c522e9e0e24f4a8ca1d1554ea35739
msgid ""
"FMU UART5 is the middle socket on the end of the PX4IO board as indicated by"
" the **red arrow** above."
msgstr "FMU UART5 是 PX4IO 板端部的中间插座，如上方 **红色箭头** 所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:182
#: 4c6c53670b084aa88ed5c818a12abb2d
msgid ""
"(FMU UARTx) means a port that is pass through connected directly from the "
"PX4IO board to the PX4FMU."
msgstr "（FMU UARTx）表示从 PX4IO 板直通连接到 PX4FMU 的端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:186
#: ccb2f8d1a1a24cc8bee448a7412b5d76
msgid "Separate Servo power for high power applications"
msgstr "大功率应用的独立舵机供电"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:191
#: e4882b5df4da4e84b28231a61d57667a
msgid ""
"**Using a separate power supply to provide power to the center servo power "
"pins of the PX4IO board.**"
msgstr "**使用独立电源为 PX4IO 板中央舵机电源针脚供电。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:194
#: 906da785fcb340e99a0cb2734ad87aff
msgid ""
"If you are driving high power servos with your PX4IO board you will want to "
"provide servo power separately."
msgstr "如果您正在用 PX4IO 板驱动大功率舵机，您需要单独提供舵机电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:196
#: 7d01274817e44aa6a33aa4b5df9557c6
msgid ""
"In order to do this, remove the L1 Ferrite device circled in red on the "
"image above."
msgstr "为此，移除上图中红色圆圈标出的 L1 铁氧体器件。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:198
#: 27eb6ba77c9e4568be3c3e717876cdfa
msgid ""
"Then run power from your separate power supply to one of the center pins of "
"the Servo Connector."
msgstr "然后将独立电源的电源线连接到舵机连接器的一个中央针脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:200
#: 3d0d466a6d9a4938808519d33c0aeff4
msgid ""
"And run the ground from your separate power supply to one of the servo "
"connector pins nearest the edge of the board."
msgstr "将独立电源的地线连接到靠近板边缘的一个舵机连接器针脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:204
#: 8a00343d8723423ca48db5203c91afe0
msgid "Using a Standard RC Radio Receiver with an 8 channel PPM Encoder"
msgstr "使用标准遥控接收机和 8 通道 PPM 编码器"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:207
#: 9147139d299e4808855139cff6b9a6eb
msgid ""
"**You can use a standard radio receiver with an 8 channel PPM Encoder in "
"place of the PPM-SUM receiver.**"
msgstr "**可以使用标准遥控接收机配合 8 通道 PPM 编码器来代替 PPM-SUM 接收机。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:210
#: a451f8b68266498f96b03f4f144d07a6
msgid ""
"An 8 Channel PPM Encoder is `available from jDrones here "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/pixhawk_px4_paparazzi_ppm_encoder_v2_p/eleppmenc20.htm>`__."
msgstr ""
"8 通道 PPM 编码器可从 `jDrones 此处购买 "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/pixhawk_px4_paparazzi_ppm_encoder_v2_p/eleppmenc20.htm>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:212
#: a96547715b034757bbe2fa5948547625
msgid ""
"Solder a 3x8 Right angle connector from the top into one end of the 8 "
"Channel PPM Encoder board."
msgstr "将3x8直角连接器从顶部焊接到8通道PPM编码器板的一端。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:214
#: 7a1d7ef0ba704b2f8fd219fba8339b08
msgid ""
"With the 3x8 connector up and facing away from you, solder a 3x1 Right angle"
" connector on the right edge of the 8 Channel PPM Encoder board."
msgstr "将 3x8 连接器朝上面向您，将 3x1 直角连接器焊接到 8 通道 PPM 编码器板的右侧边缘。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:218
#: 261010fd502b482191d09a720a7a8154
msgid ""
"**Connect 5-8 output channels of your receiver to the inputs of the 8 "
"Channel Encoder (signal wire furthest from board) with 5-8 female to female "
"servo jumpers.**"
msgstr "**使用 5-8 根母对母舵机跳线，将接收机的 5-8 输出通道连接到 8 通道编码器输入（信号线远离板面）。**"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:222
#: 7c27f06715b940eb94647b2807e20e0a
msgid ""
"Connect the PPM-SUM output of the Encoder with a 3 wire cable to the PX4IO "
"boards PPM sum input (1x3 connector)."
msgstr "用 3 线电缆将编码器的 PPM-SUM 输出连接到 PX4IO 板的 PPM sum 输入（1x3 连接器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:227
#: 01a1d0aea173465e84ff45fee2b9783a
msgid ""
"If you are using a 3DR PPM Encoder it is important to know that when you are"
" calibrating your transmitter you will quite likely need to hook up your "
"flight battery to the PX4IO because the USB port alone can't supply enough "
"power."
msgstr "如果您使用的是3DR PPM编码器，需要注意的是，在校准遥控器时，很可能需要连接飞行电池到PX4IO，因为仅靠USB口无法提供足够的电力。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:233
#: 4e9ef3f35e6e483bb9e5ffc4e757e7ca
msgid "Compatible remote control (RC) receivers"
msgstr "兼容的遥控（RC）接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:235
#: c908370b5b304f1db6caa8d4e67f0038
msgid ""
"PX4 is compatible with PPM remote control (RC) receivers, Futaba S.Bus "
"receivers, and Spektrum DSM,DSM2, and DSM-X Satellite receivers. For "
"traditional single-wire-per-channel (PWM) receivers a PPM encoder can be "
"used to convert the receiver outputs to PPM-SUM.  Information about "
"compatible receivers and how they are connected can be found in :ref:`this "
"wiki page <common-rc-systems>`."
msgstr ""
"PX4 兼容 PPM 遥控（RC）接收机、Futaba S.Bus 接收机以及 Spektrum DSM、DSM2 和 DSM-X "
"卫星接收机。对于传统每通道单线（PWM）接收机，可以使用 PPM 编码器将接收机输出转换为 PPM-SUM。有关兼容接收机及其连接方式的信息，请参见 "
":ref:`此 Wiki 页面 <common-rc-systems>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-plus-px4io-wiring.rst:244
#: fe0bd2735b854e49b0c2e4fc29c44be8
msgid "FRSky Taranis Transmitter"
msgstr "FRSky Taranis 遥控器"
